    title: "The Best Magic Experiences in Los Angeles",
    metaTitle: "Best Magic Shows in Los Angeles 2026 | White Rabbit Magic",
    metaDescription: "From the Magic Castle® to Scott Syme's Magic Monday's, discover the best magic experiences in Los Angeles. Your guide to LA's world-class magic scene.",
