      "When the Kookaburra closed its doors in 2025, the Magic Monday's community felt the loss. But Scott and Katie always knew the show would return. <strong>The Starlight Cabaret</strong>, the new venue from the same ownership team, is purpose-built for exactly the kind of intimate, high-energy entertainment that Magic Monday's delivers. The new space in Studio City offers better sightlines, upgraded production, and a setting that honors the spirit of what made the Kookaburra special while pushing the experience forward.",
      "The 2026 return of <strong>Magic Monday's at The Starlight Cabaret</strong> is more than a relaunch. It's an evolution. The rotating lineup will continue to feature top magicians from Los Angeles and beyond, alongside variety performers, comedians, mentalists, and surprise guests. The show remains accessible and fun, without the dress code or membership requirements of more formal magic venues. It's the kind of evening where you can show up in jeans, have a great cocktail, and see world-class magic performed inches from your face.",
